    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Those archetypes are a good start for the personalities, but I really need to ground them in the actual demographics of a city like Chicago or Philly to make it feel legit. Like, for the \"street\" side of things, what kind of ethnic backgrounds would make those gang leaders or hustlers feel authentic to the neighborhood? And for the detectives, I want to show the social reality of the precinct—who would typically be in those roles in a rougher part of town?",
