      "content": "To ground it geographically, your hustlers and gang leaders could reflect the deep cultural tapestry of neighborhoods, perhaps featuring characters of various African American, Latino, or South Asian backgrounds common in those urban settings. For the precinct, reflect the reality of urban police by including detectives who are drawn from the communities they patrol, often reflecting the neighborhood's demographics. This mix of cultural representation and socio-economic reality will immediately lend the grit and authenticity you're aiming for.",
