      "content": "I get the idea of a mix, but I want to get more specific with the casting profiles for the pitch deck. If I'm looking for that \"hard-hitting\" realism, give me some concrete pairings. For example, if we have a gang leader character, what's the most realistic racial profile for that role in a gritty urban setting? And conversely, when we're casting the veteran detectives or the brass at the precinct, what ethnicities typically occupy those positions of authority in these types of environments? I want to make sure the visual and cultural conflict is baked into the character descriptions.",
